  "description_en": "Detects display price tags based on price tag recognition and multimodal large model localization, extracting product information, selling prices, original prices, and locations, while providing visible bounding boxes for paper price tags, electronic price tags, and promotional price signs for store price collection, price tag inspection, and business-side price verification",
  "description_zh": "基于价签识别与多模态大模型定位构建的陈列价签检测产品。产品提取价签对应的商品信息、售价、原价及位置，并补充纸质价签、电子价签和促销价格牌的可见框，适用于门店价格采集、价签巡检与业务侧价格核对",
